    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροιζέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροιβδέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				969
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. acc.
			cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φυγάς τινι</span>
			<i>shriek</i> flight at him, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				424
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				585
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>make a
				rustling</i> or <i>whirring sound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				48.940
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				37.688
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρύζω</span>
			.</div>
